  "_comment": [
    "DELETE-UNSTARTED-WAVE-1. Where is a migration in its life: setup, planned,",
    "running or finished? ONE answer, decided in two languages: the engine and",
    "the service (Get-VmfRunStage, PowerShell) and the Migrations page",
    "(VmfHelp.runStage in src/dashboard/help.js, JavaScript).",
    "The service refuses Delete this migration while the stage is running, and",
    "the page shows Stop this migration in place of Delete then. They asked two",
    "questions: between two waves the service said running (a machine of the",
    "next wave has no state document, so it has not settled), and the page",
    "showed Delete, which the service refused. Seen on the lab install,",
    "2026-11-16: wave s1 finished, wave s2 not started.",
    "Only path A machines count. A machine in no wave that never ran is not",
    "part of the migration (entry-outside-run.json). running: at least one",
    "machine started (a state that is not PLANNED, settled ones included) and",
    "not every machine settled. A vmId is matched in any letter case.",
    "Held by tests/unit/DeleteUnstartedWave.Tests.ps1 and tests/js/delete-unstarted-wave.test.js."
  ],
